WEBVTT

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:08.900
So many people!

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:10.350
Yuzu.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:13.360
Yuzu!

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.020
Pay attention, or you'll get lost.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:19.930
Okay, Bikuni-sama.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:21.740
Move it, move it!

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:24.400
Get out of the way, or you'll get hurt!

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.770
Scoot!

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.900
S-Sorry.

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:33.000
Everything must be curious to you, 
this being your first time in the city.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:33.800
Yes.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:40.750
The cherry blossoms here are so pretty.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.450
Look, Yuzu. You can see it now.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.780
<b>Konohanatei</b>

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:04.550
This is the hotel where you'll 
be working starting today.

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:07.010
Konohanatei.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:48.060
<b>Konohana Kitan</b>

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:53.060
<b>Episode 1 
Sakuya Konohana</b>

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.480
So? Is this her?

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.720
The kid fox who wants to work here?

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:00.560
Yes.

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:04.880
All right.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:08.030
I've known you for a long time.

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:09.400
I'll take her.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:11.140
Kiri.

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.620
Yes, Okami.

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:15.920
This is Kiri, our head attendant.

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:18.090
She'll teach you what you need to know.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:20.530
M-My name is Yuzu.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:22.290
I look forward to working with you.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:40.200
All right, we don't have 
time to be sentimental.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.400
Natsume! Satsuki!

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.980
Hey, who's she?

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:44.850
The new girl?

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:45.690
Yep.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:47.580
Time to get polishing. Help her out.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.270
You heard her.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.410
You take it from here, Natsume.

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.240
That's just the way Satsuki is.

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:56.580
Don't mind her.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:58.440
<i>She's so pretty.</i>

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:00.910
<i>She reminds me of Bikuni-sama.</i>

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:02.230
All right, clothes off.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.170
Don't be so shy.

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:07.990
I can wash myself!

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:10.910
Wow, you have pretty big 
breasts for someone so short.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.850
<b>Men</b>

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.850
<b>Women</b>

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.850
<b>Closed</b>

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.060
Idiots.

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:19.010
Next up, dressing.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:23.450
I've prepared some of my kimonos.

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:26.310
You're so quick to the task, Ren.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.780
<i>And this one is so cute.</i>

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.780
Yuzu-chan, was it?

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.980
I'm Ren.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:32.240
I hope you'll be good to me.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:36.580
N-No, of course! I hope you'll be good to me.

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.990
<i>Obviously. What is she talking about?</i>

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:41.260
<i>I was being polite!</i>

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:43.020
<i>Did you think I was being serious?</i>

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:44.500
<i>What a silly fox.</i>

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.610
Thanks, Ren.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:48.850
Get back to work, now.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:49.710
Okay.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:54.320
I bet she's slow.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:58.810
There's more?

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:00.560
Shush. Just come with me.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:09.430
Konohanatei was built on the second highest 
point in the city, after the gods' shrine.

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:12.570
So this is our special privilege.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.380
Wow!

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:26.190
It's so big,

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:27.980
and there are so many people.

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:29.760
I've never seen anything like it.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.960
You two always lived on your own, huh?

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:34.550
Yes.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:45.490
And so, with that...

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:48.690
Please be her instructor, Satsuki.

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:49.700
Now, back to wor—

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.450
Wait.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.050
That's for Natsume or Ren to do.

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:54.170
Why should I—

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:56.430
Oh? You can't do it, huh?

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:59.590
Well, if even our brilliant 
Satsuki isn't up to the task...

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:01.130
I-I never said I couldn't—

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:07.250
I imagine your older sister is hard at work 
with her employees right about now.

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:11.110
Come, shrimp.

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:12.580
There's work to do.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:13.920
O-Okay.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.170
Welcome.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.860
Is the boss well?

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:30.240
Yes, <i>too</i> well.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.480
Could we have dinner early?

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.050
Understood.

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:35.760
An early meal for you.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.000
Hurry up.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.740
We have guests.

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:48.540
Are the outdoor baths this way?

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:49.130
Yes.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.690
It's just at the end of this path, sir.

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:53.240
Enjoy your stay.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:55.070
E-Enjoy your stay.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:59.130
You idiot! Get on your feet 
before our guests pass by!

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:00.220
I'm sorry.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:03.640
You're to move out of the way 
when a guest passes by. Got it?

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:05.490
U-Understood.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.200
<b>Konohanatei</b>

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.190
Man, it's a pain when we get 
a group of unannounced guests.

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.790
Hey, it looks a lot cleaner now.

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:24.330
Um...

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:27.070
But don't polish it 
too much, or you'll slip.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.920
I went overboard.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:38.420
That was an excellent bath.

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:40.330
<i>He shrank!</i>

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:51.020
A-Are you hurt, sir?

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:54.010
No. Are you, child?

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:57.360
I'm truly sorry.

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:01.620
We'll be at your room to make 
a proper apology later.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:05.780
No, no. I'm sure it must have 
hurt more for the little girl there.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:13.060
I'm sorry. That was my fault.

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:15.120
Then be careful from now on.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:17.310
Don't think you can apologize 
your way out of everything.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:21.260
Um... I'm going to go apologize by myself.

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:23.270
That's not the point.

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:26.280
Attendants all share responsibility.

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:29.220
I'm just acting on my own responsibilities.

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:33.170
Okay.

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:34.810
Thank you.

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:41.490
I always thought you were too 
individualistic to have such team spirit.

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:43.710
It's to save my own face.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:48.320
As far as a guest is concerned, one 
attendant's mistake is everyone's mistake.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:52.330
I'll be quitting this job one day, 
but I'm going to do my duty until then.

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.400
Really, I'm fine.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.600
<b>Refined Sake</b>

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:01.590
You don't need to apologize.

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:02.620
But...

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.800
What about you, child? Are you all right?

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:09.010
Yes! I have a bruise on my bum, but that's all...

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:13.500
My, you poor girl.

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:16.810
Use this.

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:18.180
It's a compress.

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:20.780
Are you a pharmacist, sir?

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:25.500
We'd like some products, then, 
including those compresses.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.330
As a token of our apology.

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:29.910
<i>You mustn't!</i>

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:32.630
An apology, you say?

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:33.540
Yes.

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:36.590
It would help your business.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:40.360
<i>Medicine is for people who are sick.</i>

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:43.250
<i>It's not something you should buy 
just to make an apology.</i>

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:47.590
Actually, there's something 
I'd like to ask of you.

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:52.350
I don't have enough of the stars 
I need to make this medicine.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:53.670
<i>Konpeitou?</i>

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:56.060
Could you knock down some stars for me?

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.760
Well?

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.280
Can you do it?

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:01.890
<i>They're just ordinary konpeitou.</i>

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:03.430
<i>He thinks I'm just a kid.</i>

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.260
With all due respect, sir...

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:06.380
Understood!

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:08.500
We'll knock down some stars!

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:18.730
What the hell are you doing?!

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:20.390
I'm trying to get some stars.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.320
Almost...

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:24.840
You just shut up!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:32.020
I knocked down a star!

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:34.230
It fell past the mountain.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.650
Please pick it up and take it home!

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:38.780
You moron!

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.720
That's what you call BS!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.490
It isn't BS.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:46.200
It's called being playful.

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:50.380
You two have given me a fun time.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.300
Thank you.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:11:00.130
I haven't answered your requests.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:01.560
I can't accept this.

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:03.820
That is medicine.

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:09.900
You have a strong sense of responsibility, 
but you ought to loosen up a little.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:14.060
That medicine will help you relax.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.900
<i>Was I wrong?</i>

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:21.230
<i>No, he was just an odd guest.</i>

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:25.450
<i>But it's true that the 
brat's quick wit saved us.</i>

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:30.360
That medicine will help you relax.

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:35.260
Okay.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:43.380
<i>I've never been in a hot spring before.</i>

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:47.530
Hi.

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:50.460
You idiot!

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:51.990
What are you thinking?

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:53.890
S-Sorry.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.180
Um...

00:11:55.520 --> 00:12:01.160
I-I've never been in a bath 
with someone my age before.

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:03.550
I-I'm embarrassed.

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:07.180
Y-You did well earlier.

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:09.120
Our guest gave us praise.

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:12.870
But I didn't do anything worth praising.

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:15.070
You're the one who told me.

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:18.670
I told you what?

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.320
That the attendants are all one.

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:25.850
We've only just met, but you've 
accepted me as one of your own.

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:29.720
So I wanted to do what I could.

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:31.010
That was...

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:33.700
<i>To save my own face.</i>

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:52.510
You idiot! Do you really want 
to drown in the hot spring?

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:54.560
S-Sorry.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:57.920
Here.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:12:59.960
Isn't this...

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.150
Damn it.

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:03.290
Have some of this and get some sleep.

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:09.260
Yuzu.

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:25.550
<i>Yuzu.</i>

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:33.640
Please come again.

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:37.960
Well, then, I think I'll go visit 
the other side of the mountain.

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:42.040
I need to pick up the 
star that you shot down.

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:43.530
No, you can't!

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:46.000
I was just being silly! 
I didn't actually shoot it down!

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.930
You won't find it past the mountain.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.390
We know that.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.530
We don't know that.

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:59.040
I won't know whether there's a star 
there or not until I take a look.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.700
Goodbye.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:21.740
<i>How amazing it would be if I could see 
people off on their travels every day.</i>

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:30.470
<i>Bikuni-sama, I'm going to work hard with 
the four other people here at Konohanatei.</i>

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:37.960
Oh, I forgot to introduce you to her.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:47.860
<b>Konohanatei</b>

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:45.760
<i>Correction... The five others.</i>

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:57.640
Quit slacking off!

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:00.330
Don't do only what's asked of you!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:02.630
If you don't know what to do, 
watch someone and learn!

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.730
Do as we do, even if you don't know why!

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:05.740
I'm sorry!

00:15:05.740 --> 00:15:07.370
Man, she's as noisy as ever.

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:08.660
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.700
You look quite beat.

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:15.550
You don't need to do everything she says.

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:19.700
Satsuki-chan is busy enough 
just taking care of me,

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:22.400
yet she does all her own work 
perfectly on top of that.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:26.360
That's why I need to work harder, 
so I don't get in her way.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.940
You're such a good girl.

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.530
Oh, yeah, Nacchan. You blew your 
nose on your obiage, didn't you?

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:31.900
Who cares if I did?

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:33.450
We're washing it, anyway.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.200
I care!

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:36.160
We're working separately?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:38.560
You partner up with me, Satsuki.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:42.230
And, Yuzu, you're partnering with Sakura.

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:47.290
U-Um, Sakura-chan...

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:52.330
Hey... Wait for me!

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:53.690
Sakura-chan!

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:07.420
H-Hey, Sakura-chan, 
what shall we do next?

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:10.190
Sakura-chan, where are you going?

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:13.650
Do as we do, even if you don't know why!

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:16.700
A-All right.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:13.840
Sakura-chan?

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:57.090
Th-Thank you.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:10.670
<i>I was so busy trying to learn my work, 
I never noticed there's so much beauty.</i>

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:21.200
Work!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.650
We have to get back to work!

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:24.350
It's still lunch break.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:28.260
There's no need to hurry.

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:32.760
Wow!

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:34.670
This is amazing!

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:38.380
Time passes so slowly when I'm with you.

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:43.110
It must be because you're finding 
so many fun things to do.

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:44.340
Fun?

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:45.360
Yes.

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:48.070
It's fun being with you.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.850
Let's go back, Sakura-chan.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:00.700
For you.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:04.370
But you spent so much time making it.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:07.370
They're just flower petals I found.

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:14.040
Thank you, Sakura-chan!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.520
I'll take good care of it.

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:24.690
How'd it go today?

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:25.590
O-Oh...

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:30.300
The scenery is so different 
when I'm with Sakura-chan.

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:36.610
She made me realize I've been too caught 
up in seeing only what's around me.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:37.450
Yeah?

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:41.770
Let's just hope you can apply it to work.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:47.280
Y-Yes, I'll do my best.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:51.090
Oh, right. I'm going to have you 
two sleep in the same room.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.500
Well then, good luck.

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:57.840
I look forward to it.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:00.910
Yeah.

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.550
That girl is weird.

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:08.200
She said it's fun being with me.

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.510
That's something she would say.

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:11.930
How about for you?

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:14.600
Is it fun being with me?

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:18.940
It's not exactly <i>fun</i>,

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:22.530
but it's comforting.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:25.780
I can let my hair down around you.

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:29.570
Kiri-chan, you should 
sleep in your own futon.

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:32.520
Whoops! I thought you were 
a high-quality pillow.

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:34.530
You're such an old fart.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:40.380
We're about to go to sleep.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.240
Why are you so hyper?

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.470
Sorry.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:46.180
I've never slept next to a friend before.

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.460
I'm so excited.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:48.720
How about a pillow fight?

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:49.540
No.

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:52.130
<i>She seriously wanted to?</i>

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:56.650
Go over to Natsume's room if you don't like it.

00:20:57.470 --> 00:20:58.970
No, it's fun.

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:01.040
<i>I don't get her.</i>

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:03.360
Goodnight.

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:10.450
It's kind of nice saying that... 
before... I go to sleep...

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:18.660
She falls asleep way too easily.

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:28.680
To learn is not only to gain 
knowledge atop a desk.

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:34.270
You must go and learn from 
many other souls, Yuzu.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:34.980
Okay.

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:44.340
Bikuni-sama...

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:03.020
Goodnight.

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Next Episode
Spring Journey</b>
